sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (Browser/App)
    participant Server as Web Server (TLS 1.3)

    Note over Client,Server: TCP Handshake Completed
    Client->>Server: ClientHello (Supported Ciphers, Key Share / Diffie-Hellman Parameter)
    Server->>Client: ServerHello + Key Share + Server Certificate + EncryptedExtensions + Finished
    Note over Client: Verify Certificate (Validity, Chain to trusted Root CA, CN/SAN matching)
    Note over Client: Compute Shared Symmetric Key (Diffie-Hellman)
    Client->>Server: Finished (Encrypted Handshake Complete)
    Note over Client,Server: Application Data Flow (AES-GCM / ChaCha20 Symmetric Encryption)
    Client->>Server: Encrypted HTTP Request
    Server-->>Client: Encrypted HTTP Response
